bound, and c) nucleotide-free (Apo). Digested samples sample were analyzed in two technical replicates using an Orbitrap Fusion Lumos Tribrid (ThermoFisher Scientific) mass spectrometer coupled with an Easy nLC 1200 chromatography system. Each sample was analyzed in 40 minutes chromatography, using linear gradients set as follows: 5 to 30% B (v/v)  (with solvent B: acetonitrile + 0.1% formic acid (v/v)) from 0 to 20 minutes, 30 to 90%  B from 20 to 35 minutes, then 90% B from 35 to 40 minutes. Instrument method was set up in DDA mode, HCD fragmentation with stepped collision energy from 30 to 34. Survey scans were acquired at resolution 60,000. Precursor selection was performed by cycle time with maximum injection time of 250 ms, and 8 seconds dynamic exclusion window. Precursor ions with charge 3+ to 8+ were selected for fragmentation. MS2 spectra were acquired with resolution 30,000.\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-5.4-nano-2026-03-17', 'store': True, 'temperature': 0.3}}
